<section class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4"
         data-controller="equity-chart"
         data-equity-chart-points-value="<%= curve_chart_data(curve).to_json %>"
         data-equity-chart-currency-value="<%= @account.currency %>">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Equity and balance</h2>
    <ul class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-0.5 w-4 bg-[#257de0]" aria-hidden="true"></span>Equity</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-0.5 w-4 bg-[#f47230]" aria-hidden="true"></span>Balance</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p class="mb-3 mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
    Balance includes deposits and withdrawals. Equity is starting capital plus closed-trade profit, so cash flows don't move it.
    Open positions are not valued, because the report has no price history.
    <% if subset %>With a symbol or robot filter, both lines show the account's capital with only the matching trades.<% end %>
  </p>
  <div class="relative h-72">
    <canvas data-equity-chart-target="equity" role="img" aria-label="Line chart of equity and balance by day. The table below lists month-end values."></canvas>
  </div>

  <h3 class="mb-2 mt-6 text-sm font-semibold">Drawdown from peak</h3>
  <div class="relative h-36">
    <canvas data-equity-chart-target="drawdown" role="img" aria-label="Chart of the deepest drawdown of each day. The table below lists the worst of each month."></canvas>
  </div>

  <details class="mt-4 text-sm">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer text-blue-600">Show as a table</summary>
    <div class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full tabular-nums">
        <thead class="text-gray-600">
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200">
            <th scope="col" class="py-1 text-left font-medium">Month</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-1 text-right font-medium">Closing equity</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-1 text-right font-medium">Closing balance</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-1 text-right font-medium">Worst drawdown</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% curve_months(curve).each do |month, last, worst| %>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <th scope="row" class="py-1 text-left font-normal"><%= month.strftime("%b %Y") %></th>
              <td class="py-1 text-right"><%= money(last.equity, @account.currency) %></td>
              <td class="py-1 text-right"><%= money(last.balance, @account.currency) %></td>
              <td class="py-1 text-right"><%= percent(worst, precision: 2) %></td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
